### 2. Backend Implementation (`/backend/app`)

#### [NEW] [schemas.py](file:///d:/Development%20(Projects)/SIH%20Project%201/backend/app/models/schemas.py)
Pydantic contracts strictly matching §6:
- `NodeSchema`: id, label, type, centrality_score, community_id, risk_flag, attributes
- `EdgeSchema`: id, source, target, type, weight, last_seen, evidence_ref, attributes
- `AnomalySchema`: id, entity_ids, description, severity, evidence_refs, attributes
- `KeyIndividualSchema`: id, label, type, centrality_score, pagerank, betweenness, community_id, rationale, risk_flag
- `HeatmapPointSchema`: day, hour, count
- `GeoPointSchema`: lat, lng, weight, location_name
- `ExtractionPreviewResponse`: extracted nodes & edges with confidence scores for confirmation before ingestion
- `CaseSummaryResponse`: full case payload with all graph, anomaly, and heatmap analytics

#### [NEW] [ner.py](file:///d:/Development%20(Projects)/SIH%20Project%201/backend/app/pipeline/ner.py)
- spaCy `en_core_web_sm` pipeline with custom `EntityRuler` and regex patterns:
  - Phone numbers: `r'\+?91?[6-9]\d{9}'`
  - Indian vehicle registration plates: `r'[A-Z]{2}-\d{2}-[A-Z]{2}-\d{4}'`
  - Monetary values: `r'(?:Rs\.?|INR|₹)\s?[\d,]+(?:\.\d+)?'`
  - Standard entity types: `PERSON`, `ORG`, `GPE`, `PHONE`, `VEHICLE`
  - Multilingual script check (detecting Devanagari or regional UTF-8 text to flag "regional-language content detected").

#### [NEW] [resolve_entities.py](file:///d:/Development%20(Projects)/SIH%20Project%201/backend/app/pipeline/resolve_entities.py)
- `rapidfuzz.fuzz.token_sort_ratio` for fuzzy name matching (resolving "Amit Sharma" / "A. Sharma", "Vikram Singh" / "V. Singh").
- Phone number canonicalization to E.164-style `+91XXXXXXXXXX`.
- Vehicle plate normalization to uppercase with consistent hyphenation.

#### [NEW] [parse_pdf.py](file:///d:/Development%20(Projects)/SIH%20Project%201/backend/app/pipeline/parse_pdf.py)
- `pdfplumber` page-by-page text extraction.
- Maps each document/page into a Document node (`doc_fir_104`, `doc_sr_409`), extracting entities and creating `MENTIONED_IN` edges with text excerpts and page references.

#### [NEW] [parse_cdr.py](file:///d:/Development%20(Projects)/SIH%20Project%201/backend/app/pipeline/parse_cdr.py)
- `pandas` CSV reader for CDR logs.
- Generates `CALLED` edges between Person/Phone nodes with timestamp, duration, tower location, and unique evidence reference (`CDR-xxxx`).

#### [NEW] [parse_txn.py](file:///d:/Development%20(Projects)/SIH%20Project%201/backend/app/pipeline/parse_txn.py)
- `pandas` Excel reader for XLSX transaction files.
- Generates `PAID` edges with amount, mode, date, remarks, and evidence reference (`TXN-xxxx`).

#### [NEW] [centrality.py](file:///d:/Development%20(Projects)/SIH%20Project%201/backend/app/analytics/centrality.py)
- Computes `nx.pagerank` and `nx.betweenness_centrality`.
- Generates combined composite centrality score (0.0–1.0) and generates human-readable one-line rationales for the Key Individuals panel.

#### [NEW] [community.py](file:///d:/Development%20(Projects)/SIH%20Project%201/backend/app/analytics/community.py)
- Computes `nx.community.louvain_communities` to assign modular cluster/cell IDs.

#### [NEW] [anomaly.py](file:///d:/Development%20(Projects)/SIH%20Project%201/backend/app/analytics/anomaly.py)
- Trains `IsolationForest` on transaction amount, frequency, duration, and hour features.
- Applies rule-based detectors (e.g. odd-hour calls between 01:00 and 04:00 AM, same-day cash withdrawals post high RTGS credit, structured rapid transactions).
- Formats each anomaly with severity, affected entities, and clickable evidence references (`TXN-1002`, `CDR-0004`, `FIR-104`).

#### [NEW] [heatmap_agg.py](file:///d:/Development%20(Projects)/SIH%20Project%201/backend/app/analytics/heatmap_agg.py)
- Temporal heatmap aggregation: buckets timestamped edges into `(day_of_week, hour) -> count`.
- Geographic heatmap aggregation: geocodes tower locations and FIR locations using a static Indian city lookup table -> `(lat, lng, weight, city)`.
- Co-occurrence matrix: entity $\times$ entity combined interaction strength score normalized 0.0–1.0.
- Chronological timeline events list filterable by entity.

#### [NEW] [case_store.py](file:///d:/Development%20(Projects)/SIH%20Project%201/backend/app/case_store.py)
- Central in-memory & SQLite-backed case manager storing case graphs, files, and precomputed analytics cache for sub-second responses.

